sify/","name":"Cinven","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-07-22","evidence":"Founded in 2012, Salsify's global operations span North America, Europe, and Australia, and the Company is headquartered in Boston, Massachusetts."},"country":{"url":"https://www.cinven.com/news-insights/cinven-to-acquire-salsify/","name":"Cinven","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-07-22","evidence":"the Company is headquartered in Boston, Massachusetts"},"business_model":{"url":"https://www.cinven.com/news-insights/cinven-to-acquire-salsify/","name":"Cinven","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-07-22","evidence":"Long track record of strong organic growth, underpinned by compelling network effects between globally leading brands and retailers, recurring revenues and high customer retention through the cycle"},"email":{"url":"https://www.salsify.com/contact-us-salsify","name":"Salsify","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"Salsify Boston One Financial Center Ste 800 Boston, MA 02111 (844) 725-7439 info@salsify.com"},"leaders":{"url":"https://www.salsify.com/team","name":"Salsify","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"Our Executive Team Piyush Chaudhari CEO ... David Forlizzi Chief Financial Officer"}},"holding":{"sponsor":"Cinven","status":"current","status_note":"Agreed to acquire Salsify in July 2026 (terms undisclosed); Cinven portfolio page dated September 2026","asset_class":"Private equity","deal_type":"Buyout","value_creation_plan":"Cinven said it will contribute its software and consumer sector expertise to support Salsify's next phase of growth, including the significant untapped market opportunity in Europe, other international markets, further US expansion and adjacent products, modules and industry verticals.","value_creation_source_url":"https://www.cinven.com/news-insights/cinven-to-acquire-salsify/","notes":"Led by Daniel Garin (Partner) and John Cuyulis (Senior Principal). The release does not name the sellers. Deal type 'Buyout' reflects Cinven agreeing to acquire Salsify, Inc."}