irectivo-del-barcelona-como-su-nuevo-director-general-368892.html","source_kind":"press","evidence":"Controladora Deportiva Águilas, subsidiaria de Grupo Ollamani, y que tiene a su cargo tanto al Club América como al Estadio Banorte, anunció la contratación del español Ferran Reverter como su director general (Proceso, 26 March 2026, quoting a statement issued by Controladora Deportiva Águilas)"},{"role":"other","name":"Emilio Azcárraga Jean","title":"Executive Chairman","source_url":"https://www.generalatlantic.com/media-article/ollamani-and-general-atlantic-form-strategic-partnership/","source_kind":"sponsor","evidence":"Emilio Azcárraga Jean, controlling shareholder of Ollamani, will serve as Executive Chairman of Grupo Águilas"}],"notes":"Legal holding entity: Controladora Deportiva Águilas, S.A.P.I. de C.V., 51% owned by Ollamani, S.A.B. (BMV: AGUILAS) and 49% by General Atlantic; the alliance is based on an enterprise value of USD 490 million subject to closing adjustments. Announced 23 December 2025, approved by Ollamani shareholders 23 February 2026, completed 15 May 2026 after Comisión Nacional Antimonopolio approval. Club América was founded in 1916; Estadio Banorte hosted the opening match of the FIFA World Cup 2026. Kraft Analytics Group (KAGR) partners on data and fan experience. No standalone revenue, EBITDA or headcount for the Grupo Águilas perimeter was found in Ollamani's filings; no own website.","sources":{"description":{"url":"https://www.generalatlantic.com/media-article/ollamani-and-general-atlantic-form-strategic-partnership/","name":"General Atlantic","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2025-12-23","evidence":"The alliance will be structured through a newly created entity that will own Club América, a leading soccer team in Mexico, Estadio Banorte, and the land parcels adjacent to the stadium (collectively, 'Grupo Águilas')"},"country":{"url":"https://www.generalatlantic.com/media-article/ollamani-and-general-atlantic-form-strategic-partnership/","name":"General Atlantic","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2025-12-23","evidence":"Mexico City, MX — December 23, 2025 — Ollamani, S.A.B. ('Ollamani') (BMV: AGUILAS) today announced the formation of a strategic partnership with General Atlantic"},"business_model":{"url":"https://www.generalatlantic.com/media-article/ollamani-and-general-atlantic-form-strategic-partnership/","name":"General Atlantic","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2025-12-23","evidence":"Estadio Banorte is currently undergoing a comprehensive modernization program aimed at upgrading infrastructure, enhancing the fan experience, expanding hospitality and premium offerings"},"leaders":{"url":"https://www.proceso.com.mx/deportes/2026/3/26/america-ficha-exdirectivo-del-barcelona-como-su-nuevo-director-general-368892.html","name":"Proceso","kind":"press","as_of":"2026-03-26","evidence":"anunció la contratación del español Ferran Reverter como su director general"},"status":{"url":"https://www.bmv.com.mx/docs-pub/eventemi/eventemi_1560360_1.pdf","name":"Ollamani evento relevante (BMV)","kind":"filing","as_of":"2026-05-15","evidence":"La alianza estratégica se estructuró a través Controladora Deportiva Águilas, S.A.P.I. de C.V., sociedad de reciente constitución en la cual Ollamani detenta una participación de control del 51% de las acciones ordinarias y General Atlantic detenta el restante 49%."}},"holding":{"sponsor":"General Atlantic","status":"current","status_note":"49% minority stake completed 15 May 2026 (alliance based on USD 490m enterprise value); Ollamani retains 51% control","asset_class":"Growth equity","deal_type":"Minority stake","value_creation_plan":"General Atlantic said the alliance is to accelerate the group's next stage of growth and innovation, partnering with Kraft Analytics Group to use its customer data platform and fan-experience expertise, with operational and technology investments to drive sustainable long-term growth across the club, stadium and real estate.","value_creation_source_url":"https://www.generalatlantic.com/media-article/ollamani-and-general-atlantic-form-strategic-partnership/","notes":"Luis Cervantes, Managing Director and Head of General Atlantic's Mexico City office, quoted. Closing confirmed by Ollamani's BMV evento relevante dated 15 May 2026: https://www.bmv.com.mx/docs-pub/eventemi/eventemi_1560360_1.pdf"}},{"name":"Legora","website":"https://legora.com","description":"Legora is the agentic operating system for legal work, supporting lawyers in research, review, and drafting across complex matters.","sector":"Technology","subsector":"Legal AI software","country":"Sweden","business_model":"B2B SaaS","email":"contact@legora.com","email_type":"generic","employees":875,"employees_text":"875+ coworkers","employees_as_of":"2026-10-01","leaders":[{"role":"ceo","name":"Max Junestrand","title":"CEO and Co-Founder","source_url":"https://legora.com/newsroom/legora-raises-550-million-series-d-to-fuel-us-growth","source_kind":"company","evidence":"Max Junestrand, CEO and Co-Founder of Legora, said"},{"role":"cfo","name":"David Eckstein","title":"Chief Financial Officer","source_url":"https://legora.com/newsroom/legora-appoints-david-eckstein-as-chief-financial-officer","source_kind":"company","evidence":"Legora today announced that David Eckstein has joined the company as Chief Financial Officer (29 January 2026)"}],"notes":"Controller entity Legora AB (Swedish org. no. 559338-6872), Stockholm. Series D of $550m at a $5.55bn valuation led by Accel (March 2026), extended by $50m to $600m at a $5.6bn post-money valuation (April 2026). Legora said in April 2026 it had surpassed $100 million in annual recurring revenue (ARR, not recorded as revenue). Used by more than 130,000 legal professionals at more than 2,000 law firms and in-house teams across over 80 markets (September 2026 boilerplate). Headcount: 875+ coworkers on the About page read 2026-10-01 (400 employees per the April 2026 release).","sources":{"description":{"url":"https://legora.com/ab