's first truly collaborative AI for lawyers', partners Merritt Hummer and Abby Meyers, stage Growth, 2026."}},{"name":"Fosber","website":"https://www.fosbergroup.com","description":"Fosber is a leading global manufacturer and supplier for the design, construction and installation of complete lines as well as individual machine units for the production of corrugated board.","sector":"Industrials","subsector":"Packaging machinery (corrugators and aftermarket parts and services)","country":"Italy","founded_year":1978,"business_model":"B2B","email":"info@fosber.it","email_type":"generic","revenue":3210634400,"revenue_currency":"CNY","revenue_period":"FY2024 (combined perimeter sold: Fosber S.p.A. group, Fosber Asia and Tiruña Asia, as reported by the seller)","leaders":[{"role":"ceo","name":"Marco Bertola","title":"Global CEO","source_url":"https://www.fosbergroup.com/en/news/detail/newsfosbergroup-acquisition/","source_kind":"company","evidence":"Marco Bertola, who has been with Fosber for more than 25 years, will serve as Global CEO of Fosber"},{"role":"coo","name":"Alessandro Baroni","title":"Group COO","source_url":"https://www.fosbergroup.com/en/about-us/directors-managers/","source_kind":"company","evidence":"Alessandro Baroni Group COO ... From 2023 to 2026, he served as Operations Director, before becoming Group COO in 2026."}],"notes":"Fosber S.p.A., Monsagrati (Lucca), Italy; operations in Italy, the US and China. Carved out of Shenzhen-listed Guangdong Dongfang Precision (002611) by Brookfield's private equity business (Brookfield Capital Partners) via Foresight Italy BidCo S.p.A. and Foresight US BidCo, Inc.; signed late 2025, completed 9 April 2026 at a value of approximately $900 million (BBUC 6-K: total consideration approximately $950 million; Brookfield Business Corporation's share of equity $173 million for a 37% economic interest). Revenue is the seller's figure for the combined sold perimeter, 2024 operating revenue RMB 321,063.44 (ten-thousand yuan units), net profit RMB 47,219.01 (ten-thousand); Brookfield says about two-thirds of profitability comes from recurring aftermarket demand. No EBITDA or headcount found from a primary source.","sources":{"description":{"url":"https://www.fosbergroup.com/en/about-us/the-group/","name":"Fosber Group","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"Fosber is a leading global manufacturer and supplier for the design, construction and installation of complete lines as well as individual machine units for the production of corrugated board."},"founded_year":{"url":"https://www.fosbergroup.com/en/about-us/the-group/","name":"Fosber Group","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"Founded in Lucca in 1978, the Fosber Group operates worldwide"},"country":{"url":"https://www.nasdaq.com/press-release/brookfield-acquire-fosber-2025-12-01","name":"Brookfield (GlobeNewswire via Nasdaq)","kind":"wire","as_of":"2025-12-01","evidence":"Founded in 1978 and headquartered in Lucca, Italy, Fosber designs and manufactures high-speed corrugating machinery and provides vital aftersales parts, maintenance and digital monitoring solutions to box manufacturers worldwide."},"business_model":{"url":"https://bbuc.brookfield.com/bbu/press-releases/brookfield-business-partners-reports-2025-year-end-results","name":"Brookfield Business Partners","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-01-30","evidence":"The business generates approximately two-thirds of its profitability from recurring aftermarket demand"},"email":{"url":"https://www.fosbergroup.com/en/news/detail/newsfosbergroup-acquisition/","name":"Fosber Group","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"Fosber S.p.A. Via Provinciale per Camaiore, 27-28 55064 Monsagrati (LU) ... (+39) 0583 3891 - info@fosber.it"},"revenue":{"url":"http://file.finance.sina.com.cn/211.154.219.97:9494/MRGG/CNSESZ_STOCK/2026/2026-3/2026-03-12/11991389.PDF","name":"Guangdong Dongfang Precision, reply to Shenzhen Stock Exchange inquiry on major asset sale (announcement 2026-009)","kind":"filing","as_of":"2026-03-12","evidence":"单位：万元 ... 2024 年度/2024 年末 ... 营业收入 321,063.44 477,785.56 67.20% (target companies vs listed company); 交易标的主要从事瓦楞纸板生产线业务及瓦楞辊业务，2024 年度营业收入合计为 32.11 亿元"},"leaders":{"url":"https://www.fosbergroup.com/en/about-us/directors-managers/","name":"Fosber Group","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"Marco Bertola Global CEO ... After Fosber's acquisition by Brookfield, he was appointed Global CEO in 2026. Alessandro Baroni Group COO"}},"holding":{"sponsor":"Brookfield Asset Management","status":"current","status_note":"Carve-out from Guangdong Dongfang Precision completed 9 April 2026 (~$900m value); BBU/BBUC holds a 37% economic interest","asset_class":"Private equity","deal_type":"Carve-out","value_creation_plan":"Brookfield said it will bring its operational expertise and scale to accelerate Fosber's digital transformation and expand its after-sales and service offerings as it continues to grow worldwide; as a carve-out from a larger conglomerate it sees opportunities to enhance growth and efficiency.","value_creation_source_url":"https://www.nasdaq.com/press-release/brookfield-acquire-fosber-2025-12-01","notes":"Invested through Brookfield Capital Partners with approximately $480 million of equity (Brookfield Business Partners about $170 million at signing). Completion confirmed in Brookfield Business Corporation's Q1 2026 6-K: https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1654795/000162828026033635/bbucq12026ex991.htm"}},{"name":"Ennov","website":"https://en.ennov.com","description":"Ennov provides a comprehensive software platform to manage the most demanding processes of life sciences organizations in a compliant and efficient way, with cloud-based solutions covering Regulatory Affairs, Pharmacovigilance, Quality, Clinical, and Document Management.","sector":"Technology","subsector":"Life sciences regulatory, quality, clinical and pharmacovigilance software","country":"France","founded_year":1999,"business_model":"B2B SaaS","