ame":"Ennov","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"Since founding the company in 1999, Olivier has driven the company's vision, strategy and growth."},"country":{"url":"https://www.ardian.com/expertise/our-portfolio?keyword=Ennov","name":"Ardian","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-07-30","evidence":"Headquartered in Paris, the company offers a unified information management platform"},"business_model":{"url":"https://en.ennov.com/news/announcement/ennov-bregal-sagemount-ardian-growth-investment/","name":"Ennov","kind":"company","as_of":"2026-05-20","evidence":"Ennov's cloud-based solutions cover Regulatory Affairs, Pharmacovigilance, Quality, Clinical, and Document Management"},"leaders":{"url":"https://en.ennov.com/about/","name":"Ennov","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"Dr. Oxana K. Pickeral Chief Executive Officer ... Sébastien Rossi-Ferrari Chief Financial Officer"}},"holding":{"sponsor":"ARDIAN","status":"current","status_note":"Minority participant (Ardian Growth) in a strategic growth investment led by Bregal Sagemount, announced May 2026; Ardian portfolio card dated 30 July 2026","asset_class":"Growth equity","deal_type":"Minority stake","value_creation_plan":"The investment will support Ennov's next phase of expansion, with a focus on AI innovation, global go-to-market acceleration, and continued investment in the product offering.","value_creation_source_url":"https://en.ennov.com/news/announcement/ennov-bregal-sagemount-ardian-growth-investment/","notes":"Ardian deal team: Alexis Saada, Olivier Roy, Alexandra Da Silva, Michelle Stitz. Lead investor Bregal Sagemount. Deal type recorded as minority stake because the release describes Ardian as participating in a round led by Bregal Sagemount."}},{"name":"Aroma-Zone","website":"https://www.aroma-zone.com","description":"Aroma-Zone offers a broad range of beauty and wellness products formulated with high-quality natural ingredients at accessible prices, sold directly through its own stores and online.","sector":"Consumer","subsector":"Natural beauty, wellness and selfcare products (omnichannel retail)","country":"France","founded_year":1999,"business_model":"B2C (direct-to-consumer, owned stores and online)","leaders":[{"role":"ceo","name":"Sabrina Herlory-Rouget","title":"Chief Executive Officer","source_url":"https://en.newsroom.eurazeo.com/news/eurazeo-enters-into-exclusive-discussions-with-partners-group-regarding-the-contemplated-sale-of-its-stake-in-aroma-zone-and-its-reinvestment-ed1d9-52e2c.html","source_kind":"sponsor","evidence":"Sabrina Herlory-Rouget, Chief Executive Officer of Aroma-Zone, underlined (Partners Group's release names her 'Sabrina Herlory, Chief Executive Officer, Aroma-Zone')"}],"notes":"Founded by the Vausselin family in 1999; Eurazeo invested in 2021. On 6 August 2026 Partners Group entered exclusive talks to acquire a majority stake from Eurazeo Capital IV, with Eurazeo Capital V reinvesting and retaining a significant minority stake; approximately EUR 576 million gross proceeds to Eurazeo's balance sheet; subject to works-council consultation, antitrust clearance and closing conditions. Since 2021 revenues tripled (36% CAGR over four years per Partners Group), stores up seven-fold, more than five million active customers; footprint in France, Belgium, Italy and the UK. Partners Group's private credit program has lent to the company since 2021. The company website returned 403 to automated reads; no revenue figure from the company, a filing or major press was found (trade-press figures conflict), so revenue is left blank.","sources":{"description":{"url":"https://www.partnersgroup.com/en/news-and-views/press-releases/investment-news/detail?news_id=241a6a19-75ec-440f-afea-6482b2a73c8b","name":"Partners Group","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-08-06","evidence":"Founded in 1999, Aroma-Zone offers a broad range of beauty and wellness products formulated with high-quality natural ingredients at accessible prices. The Company serves a large customer base ... directly through both its owned stores and online."},"founded_year":{"url":"https://en.newsroom.eurazeo.com/news/eurazeo-enters-into-exclusive-discussions-with-partners-group-regarding-the-contemplated-sale-of-its-stake-in-aroma-zone-and-its-reinvestment-ed1d9-52e2c.html","name":"Eurazeo","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-08-06","evidence":"Founded by the Vausselin family in 1999 and supported by Eurazeo since 2021"},"country":{"url":"https://en.newsroom.eurazeo.com/news/eurazeo-enters-into-exclusive-discussions-with-partners-group-regarding-the-contemplated-sale-of-its-stake-in-aroma-zone-and-its-reinvestment-ed1d9-52e2c.html","name":"Eurazeo","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-08-06","evidence":"while continuing to strengthen its French foundation and scale its international footprint"},"business_model":{"url":"https://www.partnersgroup.com/en/news-and-views/press-releases/investment-news/detail?news_id=241a6a19-75ec-440f-afea-6482b2a73c8b","name":"Partners Group","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-08-06","evidence":"The Company serves a large customer base, diversified across demographics and income brackets, directly through both its owned stores and online."},"leaders":{"url":"https://en.newsroom.eurazeo.com/news/eurazeo-enters-into-exclusive-discussions-with-partners-group-regarding-the-contemplated-sale-of-its-stake-in-aroma-zone-and-its-reinvestment-ed1d9-52e2c.html","name":"Eurazeo","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-08-06","evidence":"Together with the management team led by Sabrina Herlory-Rouget ... Sabrina Herlory-Rouget, Chief Executive Officer of Aroma-Zone"}},"holding":{"sponsor":"Partners Group","status_note":"Exclusive talks to acquire a majority stake from Eurazeo announced 6 August 2026; completion subject to regulatory approvals","asset_class":"Private equity","deal_type":"Secondary buyout","value_creation_plan":"Partners Group plans to support management in accelerating value creation: scaling the platform to make its products available to more consumers, investing in product innovation, and rapidly building footprints in existing and new markets, positioning Aroma-Zone as an omnichannel destination for accessible beauty and wellness across Europe.","value_creation_source_url":"https://www.partnersgroup.com/en/news-and-views/press-releases/investment-news/detail?news_id=241a6a19-75ec-440f-afea-6482b2a73c8b","notes":"Majority acquisition through Partners Group's direct private equity program; Eurazeo (Capital V) to retain a significant minority stake. Led by Andreas Holzmüller, Managing Director, Private Equity Goods & Products. Status left blank because no release confirms completion."}},{"name":"NextGen Security","website":"https://www.nextgensecured.com","description":"NextGen Security is a US electronic security systems integrator that designs, installs, services, and maintains integrated security solutions spanning access control, video management, intrusion detection, and weapons detection.","sector":"Business services","subsector":"Electronic security systems integration","country":"United States","founded_year":2012,"business_model":"B2B (also serves government and utilities)","email":"info@nextgensecured.com","email_type":"generic","leaders":[{"role":"ceo","name":"Frank Brewer","title":"CEO & Co-Founder","source_url":"https://nextgensecured.com/about/","source_kind":"company","evidence":"Executive Leadership Frank Brewer CEO & Co-Founder"},{"role":"coo","name":"Ryan Loughin","title":"COO and Co-Founder","source_url":"https://nextgensecured.com/about/","source_kind":"company","evidence":"Ryan Loughin is the Chief Operating Officer and co-founder of NextGen Security"},{"role":"cfo","name":"Dwight Smith","title":"Chief Administration & Finance Officer","source_url":"https://nextgensecured.com/about/","source_kind":"company","evidence":"As Chief Administration & Finance Officer at NextGen Security, Dwight has direct oversight of daily financial activities, procurement, information systems, human resources & administration"},{"role":"other","name":"Clayton Brewer","title":"President (East Division)","source_url":"https://nextgensecured.com/about/","source_kind":"company","evidence":"Clayton Brewer President ... As President of the East Division of NextGen Security"}],"notes":"Headquartered in Exton, Pennsylvania; eight offices/branches serving customers in 41 states (Apax: across the United States and Canada), in end markets including utilities, healthcare, education and government. Acquired by the Apax Funds from Dunes Point Capital, completed 9 September 2026; terms undisclosed; management retains a significant shareholding and Frank Brewer remains the largest individual shareholder. No revenue, EBITDA or headcount published.","sources":{"description":{"url":"https://www.apax.com/partnerships/nextgen-security/","name":"Apax","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-09-09","evidence":"NextGen Security is a US electronic security systems integrator. The Company designs, installs, services, and maintains integrated security solutions spanning access control, video management, intrusion detection, and weapons detection"},"founded_year":{"url":"https://www.apax.com/news-views/apax-funds-complete-acquisition-of-nextgen-security-from-dunes-point-capital/","name":"Apax","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-09-09","evidence":"Founded in 2012 and headquartered in Exton, Pennsylvania, NextGen designs, installs, services, and maintains integrated security systems"},"country":{"url":"https://www.apax.com/news-views/apax-funds-complete-acquisition-of-nextgen-security-from-dunes-point-capital/","name":"Apax","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-09-09","evidence":"Founded in 2012 and headquartered in Exton, Pennsylvania"},"business_model":{"url":"https://www.apax.com/news-views/apax-funds-complete-acquisition-of-nextgen-security-from-dunes-point-capital/","name":"Apax","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-09-09","evidence":"delivered from eight branches to customers in end markets including utilities, healthcare, education, and government"},"email":{"url":"https://nextgensecured.com/contact/","name":"NextGen Security","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"Headquarters 484-235-5520 24/7 Email info@nextgensecured.com"},"leaders":{"url":"https://nextgensecured.com/about/","name":"NextGen Security","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"Frank Brewer CEO & Co-Founder ... Ryan Loughin COO and Co-Founder ... Dwight Smith Chief Administration & Finance Officer"}},"holding":{"sponsor":"Apax","status":"current","status_note":"Acquired from Dunes Point Capital; completed 9 September 2026 (terms undisclosed)","asset_class":"Private equity","deal_type":"Secondary buyout","value_creation_plan":"With support from the Apax Funds, NextGen intends to accelerate growth by investing in its salesforce, expanding in high-growth end markets such as data centers, building out its national accounts program for multi-site customers, and pursuing selective acquisitions to expand its geographic footprint.","value_creation_source_url":"https://www.apax.com/news-views/apax-funds-complete-acquisition-of-nextgen-security-from-dunes-point-capital/","notes":"Apax partnership page: investment year 2026, sector Services, deal status Current. Nedu Ottih, Partner at Apax, quoted."}},{"name":"Biogaran","website":"https://biogaran.fr","description":"Biogaran is a French pharmaceutical laboratory and one of France's major generic medicines companies, offering treatments across the full spectrum of therapeutic areas, with growing positions in biosimilars and consumer healthcare products.","sector":"Healthcare","subsector":"Generic pharmaceuticals, biosimilars and consumer healthcare","country":"France","business_model":"B2B (asset-light: 100% of production subcontracted; supplies pharmacies through wholesalers)","employees":270,"employees_text":"its team of 270 employees","employees_as_of":"2026-01-30","revenue":1122000000,"revenue_currency":"EUR","revenue_period":"FY 2023/24 (statutory net revenue, 'CA net statutaire en 23/24')","leaders":[{"role":"ceo","name":"Erick Roche","title":"Chief Executive Officer (appointed effective by end of March 2026)","source_url":"https://www.bcpartners.com/news/bc-partners-and-bpifrance-confirm-the-completion-of-the-acquisition-of-biogaran-starting-a-new-chapter-of-growth-for-one-of-frances-major-generic-medicines-companies/","source_kind":"sponsor","evidence":"With the completion of the acquisition, Erick Roche will be appointed Chief Executive Officer of Biogaran, effective by the end of March 2026. Erick Roche ... having previously served as the company's CEO for 15 years."}],"notes":"Founded by Servier (over 25 years ago per BC Partners); acquired from Servier by BC Partners with Bpifrance as a significant minority shareholder and board member, completed 30 January 2026 after EU clearances and French FDI authorisation; terms undisclosed. BC Partners committed to keep headquarters and operations in France, safeguard jobs and preserve the subcontracting model. Company figures (internal data, page updated January 2026): leader in reimbursable generics, more than 1 in 8 medicine boxes sold in French pharmacies, 356 million boxes a year, 1,078 references, 100% subcontracted production (89% in Europe), more than 250 employees (August 2025). Trade press (mypharma-editions) reports Erick Roche took office as président-directeur général on 31 March 2026. No EBITDA published.","sources":{"description":{"url":"https://www.bcpartners.com/news/servier-and-bc-partners-enter-exclusive-negotiations-for-the-sale-of-biogaran/","name":"BC Partners","kind":"sponsor","as_of":null,"evidence":"Biogaran, a leader in the generic market in France and an active contributor to cost savings in the French healthcare system, was founded by Servier over 25 years ago ... Today, Biogaran offers treatments across the full spectrum of therapeutic areas"},"country":{"url":"https://www.bcpartners.com/news/bc-partners-and-bpifrance-confirm-the-completion-of-the-acquisition-of-biogaran-starting-a-new-chapter-of-growth-for-one-of-frances-major-generic-medicines-companies/","name":"BC Partners","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-01-30","evidence":"BC Partners has made several commitments to the French authorities, including maintaining the company's headquarters and operations in France"},"business_model":{"url":"https://biogaran.fr/nos-missions/qui-sommes-nous/cession","name":"Biogaran","kind":"company","as_of":"2026-01-01","evidence":"100 % de la production Biogaran est réalisée en sous-traitance"},"employees":{"url":"https://www.bcpartners.com/news/bc-partners-and-bpifrance-confirm-the-completion-of-the-acquisition-of-biogaran-starting-a-new-chapter-of-growth-for-one-of-frances-major-generic-medicines-companies/","name":"BC Partners","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-01-30","evidence":"He returns with the ambition to build on Biogaran's strong foundations, support its team of 270 employees"},"revenue":{"url":"https://biogaran.fr/nos-missions/qui-sommes-nous/cession","name":"Biogaran","kind":"company","as_of":"2025-08-31","evidence":"1,122M€ CA net statutaire en 23/24 (Source: Données internes - Août 2025; page 'Màj Janv 2026')"},"leaders":{"url":"https://www.bcpartners.com/news/bc-partners-and-bpifrance-confirm-the-completion-of-the-acquisition-of-biogaran-starting-a-new-chapter-of-growth-for-one-of-frances-major-generic-medicines-companies/","name":"BC Partners","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-01-30","evidence":"Erick Roche will be appointed Chief Executive Officer of Biogaran, effective by the end of March 2026"}},"holding":{"sponsor":"BC Partners","status":"current","status_note":"Acquired from Servier alongside Bpifrance (significant minority); completed 30 January 2026","asset_class":"Private equity","deal_type":"Carve-out","value_creation_plan":"BC Partners said it will build on Biogaran's position as an important provider of generic pharmaceuticals to the French market while helping to fuel further expansion in biosimilars and consumer healthcare products, reinforcing its leadership in generics and investing in the next stage of growth.","value_creation_source_url":"https://www.bcpartners.com/news/bc-partners-and-bpifrance-confirm-the-completion-of-the-acquisition-of-biogaran-starting-a-new-chapter-of-growth-for-one-of-frances-major-generic-medicines-companies/","notes":"Cédric Dubourdieu, Partner and Head of France at BC Partners, quoted. Recorded as a carve-out because Biogaran was a Servier subsidiary sold out of the group."}},{"name":"Arlettie","website":"https://www.arlettie.com","description":"Arlettie is the leading omnichannel inventory management platform for luxury brands, organising exclusive private sales events on behalf of more than 220 active luxury and contemporary brand partners across showrooms in Paris, London, Milan and New York City, as well as online.","sector":"Business services","subsector":"Luxury inventory management and private sales (stock clearance)","country":"France","founded_year":2011,"business_model":"B2B (consignment-based, asset-light; sells to consumers through private sales on behalf of brands)","email":"partenaire@arlettie.fr","email_type":"generic","leaders":[{"role":"other","name":"Muryel Lanneau","title":"Co-founder","source_url":"https://www.paipartners.com/mediaitem/pai-partners-to-acquire-a-majority-stake-in-arlettie/","source_kind":"sponsor","evidence":"in partnership with its founders Muryel Lanneau and Thibaut Caillemer du Ferrage"},{"role":"other","name":"Thibaut Caillemer du Ferrage","title":"Co-founder","source_url":"https://www.paipartners.com/mediaitem/pai-partners-to-acquire-a-majority-stake-in-arlettie/","source_kind":"sponsor","evidence":"Muryel Lanneau and Thibaut Caillemer du Ferrage, the founders of Arlettie, said"}],"notes":"Headquartered in France (PAI). Founders opened their first sample-sales showroom (Adèle Sand) in Paris in 2004; Arlettie launched in 2011 and became the name of all entities in 2014; founders took majority control with BNPP in 2017. More than 220 brand partners, over 120,000 active consumers; revenue more than tripled in the last four years (no figure disclosed). PAI Mid-Market Fund II agreed to acquire a majority stake on 3 June 2026 (expected close early July 2026; PAI lists investment date July 2026). Founders' executive titles are not stated in the release; no revenue, EBITDA or headcount published.","sources":{"description":{"url":"https://www.paipartners.com/mediaitem/pai-partners-to-acquire-a-majority-stake-in-arlettie/","name":"PAI Partners","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-06-03","evidence":"Arlettie is the leading omnichannel inventory management platform for luxury brands, organising exclusive private sales events on behalf of more than 220 active luxury and contemporary brand partners. Operating across showrooms in Paris, London, Milan and New York City, as well as online"},"founded_year":{"url":"https://www.arlettie.com/us/en/our-story","name":"Arlettie","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"2011 Arlettie is launched, a new player in the league of luxury ... (2004 Muryel and Thibaut create Adèle Sand, their first sample sales showroom in the Marais, Paris.)"},"country":{"url":"https://www.paipartners.com/investments/","name":"PAI Partners","kind":"sponsor","as_of":null,"evidence":"Investment date July 2026 Fund PAI Mid-Market Fund II Headquarters France Business Services Arlettie"},"business_model":{"url":"https://www.paipartners.com/mediaitem/pai-partners-to-acquire-a-majority-stake-in-arlettie/","name":"PAI Partners","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-06-03","evidence":"Arlettie operates a differentiated, consignment-based and asset-light business model, with long-standing relationships with more than 220 luxury and contemporary brands"},"email":{"url":"https://www.arlettie.com/us/en/contact","name":"Arlettie","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"You are a brand email partenaire@arlettie.fr"},"leaders":{"url":"https://www.paipartners.com/mediaitem/pai-partners-to-acquire-a-majority-stake-in-arlettie/","name":"PAI Partners","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-06-03","evidence":"in partnership with its founders Muryel Lanneau and Thibaut Caillemer du Ferrage"}},"holding":{"sponsor":"PAI Partners","status":"current","status_note":"Majority stake agreed 3 June 2026 via PAI Mid-Market Fund II, alongside the founders; PAI lists investment date July 2026","asset_class":"Private equity","deal_type":"Buyout","value_creation_plan":"With PAI's support, Arlettie aims to accelerate its international expansion, particularly in the United States, further scale its omnichannel platform, deepen relationships with existing luxury partners and onboard new brands, with continued investment in technology, customer engagement and operational capabilities.","value_creation_source_url":"https://www.paipartners.com/mediaitem/pai-partners-to-acquire-a-majority-stake-in-arlettie/","notes":"Stefano Drago, Founding Partner in PAI's Mid-Market Fund, quoted. PAI's investments page lists Arlettie (Business Services, HQ France, PAI Mid-Market Fund II)."}},{"name":"1741 Group","website":"https://www.1741group.com/en/","description":"1741 Group is an independent Swiss fund servicing platform specialising in fund administration and management company (ManCo) services for asset managers holding both traditional listed UCITS and alternative assets.","sector":"Financial services","subsector":"Fund administration and management company (ManCo) services","country":"Switzerland","founded_year":2016,"business_model":"B2B","employees":70,"employees_text":"c. 70","employees_as_of":"2026-12-31","leaders":[{"role":"ceo","name":"Benedikt Czok","title":"CEO (Group CEO)","source_url":"https://www.nordiccapital.com/portfolio-cases/investments/1741-group/","source_kind":"sponsor","evidence":"MANAGEMENT Dr. Benedikt Czok CEO"},{"role":"cfo","name":"Harry Leonhardt","title":"CFO","source_url":"https://www.nordiccapital.com/portfolio-cases/investments/1741-group/","source_kind":"sponsor","evidence":"MANAGEMENT Harry Leonhardt CFO"},{"role":"coo","name":"Stefan Schädler","title":"COO","source_url":"https://www.nordiccapital.com/insights/press-releases/1741-group-secures-nordic-capital-as-experienced-financial-investor/","source_kind":"sponsor","evidence":"Stefan Schädler, COO of 1741 Group, added"}],"notes":"Headquartered in St. Gallen, with presence in Liechtenstein (Vaduz) and Luxembourg (Munsbach branch since 2021); assets under administration exceeding CHF 23 billion (January 2026). Nordic Capital (Evolution, its mid-market strategy; fund Nordic Capital Evolution I) signed to acquire a majority stake on 29 January 2026; CEO Benedikt Czok keeps approximately 20%; co-founder and Co-CEO Markus Wagner stepped down to an advisory role. Employee count is from Nordic Capital's portfolio page (c. 70; page undated, year given as 2026). No revenue or EBITDA published; the site prints only personal email addresses.","sources":{"description":{"url":"https://www.nordiccapital.com/portfolio-cases/investments/1741-group/","name":"Nordic Capital","kind":"sponsor","as_of":null,"evidence":"1741 Group is an independent Swiss fund servicing platform specialising in fund administration and management company (ManCo) services for asset managers holding both traditional listed UCITS and alternative assets"},"founded_year":{"url":"https://www.nordiccapital.com/portfolio-cases/investments/1741-group/","name":"Nordic Capital","kind":"sponsor","as_of":null,"evidence":"1741 Group was founded in 2016 and has since established itself as one of the most significant independent fund services providers in the Swiss market"},"country":{"url":"https://www.nordiccapital.com/portfolio-cases/investments/1741-group/","name":"Nordic Capital","kind":"sponsor","as_of":null,"evidence":"Headquartered in St. Gallen, the Group operates predominantly across Switzerland, with further presence in Liechtenstein and Luxembourg"},"business_model":{"url":"https://www.nordiccapital.com/portfolio-cases/investments/1741-group/","name":"Nordic Capital","kind":"sponsor","as_of":null,"evidence":"offering fund administration and management company (ManCo) services to a broadly diversified client base of asset managers, pension funds and family offices"},"employees":{"url":"https://www.nordiccapital.com/portfolio-cases/investments/1741-group/","name":"Nordic Capital","kind":"sponsor","as_of":null,"evidence":"EMPLOYEES c. 70 OWNERSHIP Nordic Capital Evolution I INVESTMENT DATE 2026 HEAD OFFICE St. Gallen, Switzerland"},"leaders":{"url":"https://www.nordiccapital.com/portfolio-cases/investments/1741-group/","name":"Nordic Capital","kind":"sponsor","as_of":null,"evidence":"MANAGEMENT Dr. Benedikt Czok CEO MANAGEMENT Harry Leonhardt CFO"}},"holding":{"sponsor":"Nordic Capital","status":"current","status_note":"Majority stake agreed 29 January 2026 via Nordic Capital Evolution I; management (CEO ~20%) reinvested","asset_class":"Private equity","deal_type":"Buyout","value_creation_plan":"Nordic Capital will support 1741 Group's next phase of growth, organically and through targeted bolt-on acquisitions, aiming to build a leading independent European fund services platform through automation and technology and further expansion into private equity, real estate and other illiquid strategies.","value_creation_source_url":"https://www.nordiccapital.com/portfolio-cases/investments/1741-group/","notes":"David Samuelson, Partner at Nordic Capital Advisors, quoted. Fourteenth investment announced by the Evolution platform since 2021."}},{"name":"Cint","website":"https://www.cint.com","description":"Cint is the technology foundation for continuous research and measurement, connecting researchers, advertisers, and brands to reliable data from the world's largest network of high-quality sources across 130+ countries.","sector":"Technology / Business services","subsector":"Programmatic market research marketplace and media measurement","country":"Sweden","fo